  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/IMG_6826.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Dissabte 9 de setembre va obrir a Onda el nou cicle Jazz de Dins, a la pla&ccedil;a de l&#39;Almud&iacute;, el grup local Colombo.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/PraVoceJazzDeDins.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Aquest dissabte 16 ha sigut el torn de Pra Voc&ecirc;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/CartellMiqueleta.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 679px;\" /></p>\n<p>Es tancaran les actuacions diumenge 24 de setembre amb la L&iacute;rica Big Band de Silla i l&#39;Onda Big Band, a les 19.30 hores al Raval de Sant Josep, dins de la Fira de Sant Miquel i la Miqueleta, nova proposta d&#39;Hosturionda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzfontdedins/img_6824.jpg\" alt=\"img_6824\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzfontdedins/img_6825.jpg\" alt=\"img_6825\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzfontdedins/img_6826.jpg\" alt=\"img_6826\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzfontdedins/img_6827.jpg\" alt=\"img_6827\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzfontdedins/img_6828.jpg\" alt=\"img_6828\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzfontdedins/img_6830.jpg\" alt=\"img_6830\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzfontdedins/img_6832.jpg\" alt=\"im